# The build reads only these files (npm ci, tsc and vite build). Everything else stays out of the context:
# node_modules, dist, .env files, test output and coverage included.
# A new build input (for example public/) must be added to the allowlist below; the allowlist drops it silently otherwise.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!index.html
!tsconfig.json
!vite.config.ts
!orval.config.ts
!src/
